 have p':=MountainNX F p g0 G' V pV D' pL gH tg V' pV' e δ qH U Κ Z U0 d0 pΓ (s+1) h v
 let hT:=T.sign.art.rotate _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ (pV.loop E v) (pV'.loop Θ v) e δ qH (U s) Κ (pL.grade s) (U0.crest s a v.le) U0.rib (gH.kind s Θ v.le) ?o (ladderNX F p g0 G' V pV D' pL gH tg V' pV' e δ qH U Κ Z U0 d0 s a v p') z q -- tune Meta
